# 基础词 Unit 09 短语

## 常考短语

- **distinguish A from B**: 区分A和B — Can you distinguish fact from fiction? 你能区分事实和虚构吗？
- **distribute to**: 分配给 — Food was distributed to refugees. 食物被分发给难民。
- **a diverse range of**: 多种多样的 — The store offers a diverse range. 商店提供多种选择。
- **be dominant in**: 在…中占主导 — The company is dominant in the field. 公司在该领域占主导。
- **be doomed to**: 注定 — The plan was doomed to fail. 计划注定失败。
- **a draft of**: 草稿 — He showed me the draft. 他给我看了草稿。
- **dramatic change**: 巨大变化 — The city has undergone dramatic changes. 城市经历了巨大变化。
- **due to**: 由于 — The delay was due to weather. 延误是由于天气。
- **in due course**: 在适当时候 — You will hear from us in due course. 你会在适当时候收到回复。
- **dump on**: 把…推给 — Don't dump your problems on me. 不要把问题推给我。
- **be eager to**: 渴望做 — She was eager to start. 她渴望开始。
- **have an effect on**: 对…有影响 — The policy had a positive effect. 政策有积极影响。
- **in effect**: 实际上 — The new rule is now in effect. 新规则现已生效。
- **elaborate on**: 详细阐述 — Could you elaborate on this? 你能详细阐述吗？
- **distinct from**: 与…不同 — The two cultures are distinct. 两种文化截然不同。
- **a distinction between**: …之间的区别 — There is a clear distinction. 有明确区别。
- **be domestic market**: 国内市场 — The company targets the domestic market. 公司面向国内市场。
- **a dose of**: 一剂 — A dose of humor helps. 一点幽默有帮助。
- **drift apart**: 渐行渐远 — The friends drifted apart over time. 朋友们随着时间渐行渐远。
- **dull pain**: 隐隐作痛 — She felt a dull pain in her back. 她感到背部隐隐作痛。

